        "original_id": "e91c4748-ed6e-5885-b2d1-979be1ee9d80",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Yeshashework Yilma, Haile Selassie I, Dejazmatch Yilma Makonnen\n- Places: Ethiopia, Harar\n- Roles: governor of Harar, regent of Ethiopia, emperor of Ethiopia\n\nFacts:\n- Haile Selassie I was born Tafari Makonnen Woldemikael on 23 July 1892.\n- Haile Selassie I served as Ethiopia's regent from 1916 to 1930.\n- Haile Selassie I served as emperor of Ethiopia from 1930 to 1974.\n- Princess Yeshashework Yilma was the daughter of Dejazmatch Yilma Makonnen.\n- Dejazmatch Yilma Makonnen was governor of Harar.\n- Princess Yeshashework Yilma was a niece of Emperor Haile Selassie of Ethiopia.\n- Princess Yeshashework Yilma died in 1982.",
